    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3[b]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAs">V As</ref> 3[b]</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[And ylce man ðe wille mot gebeten ylce gestale wiþ ðone teonde butan ylcum wite oþ gong-dagas; ⁊ beo syþþan swa hit ær wæs.] [Ld]</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And every man who so wishes may pay to his accuser compensation for every theft, without any manner of fine, until Rogation days. But after that it [the fine] shall be [paid] as it had been in the past.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And ylce man ðe wille mot gebeten ylce gestale wiþ ðone teonde butan ylcum wite oþ gong-dagas; ⁊ beo syþþan swa hit ær wæs.</ab>
      </div>
